{
  "$notes": [
    "Every tunable of design §31 plus §5.5, §9.2-9.3, §10.4, §11.1, §12.2-12.7, §14.4-14.8, §22.1, §22.5, §22.7.",
    "Period changes (owner decisions): Corvani horsemen/javelinmen replace lancers/crossbowmen; Strand-Riders charge 1.5; no draugar/frost-giant (barrowWardens, hermitClan, wolfPack, greatBear instead); galley 'seaFire' replaces 'wyrmfire'; swords need weapon tier 3 in duels; fort tier 4 = old imperial stone walls (some Corvani/Saraleonese cities only).",
    "Values marked INVENTED in ARCHITECTURE.md are not in the design and are first guesses for the balance harness to tune.",
    "Single source per rule: per-culture, per-feat and per-trait effects live ONLY in the modifier bags of cultures.json/feats.json/traits.json (e.g. Eyjar walls = fort.startTierDelta, Hall-Burner = fire.spreadPct, lost fingers = the lostFingers trait); this file holds the general formulas. Straits tolls are the §31.1 formula here (economy.straitsTollPerProvince × straitsTollMult) and the Eyjar culture bonus is descriptive.",
    "Smithy/armoury gates follow §12.4 (equipment tier 3 needs Smithy II, tiers 4-5 need Smithy III): buildings.smithy maxArmouryTier is 2/3/5, superseding the 3/4/5 of the §10.4 table (pending owner confirmation)."
